  "notes": "MAL-026. REST-only agent command, independently gated by MCP_AGENT_LANDING_DESTINATION_ENABLED. Never publishes, activates, deletes, creates Meta objects, changes budgets, or accepts caller-provided intent, URL, digest, actor or approval."
